Correct.  Though you might should have put a SPOILER ^L in front of the
bug.  The money you get from each drop is dependent on the level.  The lower
the level, the greater the possible range of money.  This bug obviates the
use of any equipment or monsters save 1 gold, and thus is by far the worst
bug I have ever seen.

